# Backend origin the app talks to. Used by src/api/config.ts (BACKEND_URL) for every
# REST call, the SSE report stream, and resolving relative photo URLs.
#
# Web dev (browser on this Mac):     http://localhost:8080
# iOS device on your Wi-Fi (LAN):    http://<your-mac-LAN-ip>:8080   e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8080
#   - find it with:  ipconfig getifaddr en0
#   - the phone must be on the same Wi-Fi as the Mac
#   - plain http to a LAN IP needs the ATS exception already set in ios/ (see MOBILE.md)
# Hosted backend:                    https://api.yourdomain.com
#
# This is baked in at BUILD time (Vite), so re-run the build + `npx cap sync` after changing it.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
